{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10010_01_k",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:89d1924816bb84e9e4ae224d590fd9d018b828e7dfc09bf90692e92fc91e983c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2364eefcd36a0b58edb1d7109b376b0093176eb2d1534b982a76d40c033019",
      "text": "朱雀的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cac41071f8f265a5194eb81b9bb8538009c45d4b727a8c30018e31d9412a2d5",
      "text": "喵，喵啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca3d9b2e95b4a08eed5b134b806cfc0951786b12857b85b706901ae5a10ba0b9",
      "text": "噢，喵子也对杂志感兴趣吗？\n一起看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac2cb8d7481610333ba74d5ff49f803bdea16e211c6178013541e8a41e03bfc0",
      "text": "这个月的特辑是……嗯？\n这、这不全是我们报道嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ea5f9c16c39e5a34be5bd2fed3cff7d47b93b078c08f1b38a382dc2ad5be99",
      "text": "写的什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1010df58129afd3d3aed9135690cdb19145b40e83749862d9eded54b31d3419f",
      "text": "“神速一魂的歌声中倾注了灵魂。\n非常符合本杂志风格的激情歌曲”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71cb90bdf9f96f8070e355336ffb6c85d0a2af7d83eed645cb6601b61cb6abf4",
      "text": "“由衷庆幸能拜托这群热血汉子。\n令人期待他们的未来”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88bc74a1b1cfa35846bbf60e32ea1b07c15df2a89312eeda4dd7320a6fce2f80",
      "text": "然后这边是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea2fb58d823f8a5d0e9ece73d225cd28a8997f7ad8b2651bf48cd8b9813a010",
      "text": "“神速一魂展现出了不似配角的强烈存在感，\n敬请前往影院一睹雄姿！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fff003ac472e5f3f008e238611face211b96d5eb075f7ff80301b1e5a8e808e",
      "text": "呜喔喔喔，太棒了！\n成功啦，喵子！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360ba9083c5956cea80a92783b8bc7c49b4b06080d9ee4b822bed4c2b6131917",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48acec0e07759db56b70bd3c059b2e29adca9282a9bddb01e70aa59e3020902b",
      "text": "可不能在这干坐着了，赶紧骑自行车去兜一圈吧！\n跟上来，喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
